    "personal_information": "NISHA SUDHAKAR PATIL\nOperations Analyst | Middle Office Solutions – Trade Operations\nPune, Maharashtra | +91 9702164555 | nishupatil31012000@gmail.com\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/nisha-patil-192a75325",
    "summary": "PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nOperations Analyst with 2.5+ years of experience in Middle Office Trade Operations at Citco Group Services (India) LLP. Recognized as Employee of the Quarter for sustaining 100% SLA adherence across Fixed Income, Equities, and OTC Derivatives trade affirmations. Experienced in trade affirmation, settlement instruction management, exception investigation, broker/prime broker coordination, SSI maintenance, and process documentation.",
    "experience": "PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nCitco Group Services (India) LLP – Pune, Maharashtra\nOperations Analyst – Middle Office Solutions (Trade Operations)\nFeb 2024 – Present\nManage 50–70 manual trade affirmations per client daily across Fixed Income, Equities, and FX using CTM (DTCC) and Traiana with 100% SLA adherence.\nResolve 30–40 daily trade exceptions by investigating ISIN mismatches, trade economics, SSIs, and static data issues.\nCoordinate with Executing Brokers, Prime Brokers, Fund Managers, and clients to resolve settlement discrepancies.\nMaintain Standing Settlement Instructions (SSIs) across DTC, Fedwire, and Euroclear with working knowledge of SWIFT MT messaging.\nTrain junior team members on platform navigation, break handling, and client communication.\nCreate and maintain SOPs for exception handling and operational processes.\nS.M. Bhoir & Co. – Navi Mumbai\nTax Associate\nJun 2022 – Jun 2023\nAssisted with GST registration, GSTR-1 & GSTR-3B filing, statutory compliance, and Income Tax Return documentation for salaried individuals.",
    "skills": "CORE COMPETENCIES\n• Middle Office Trade Operations\n• Trade Affirmation & Matching\n• Trade Lifecycle Management (T+0/T+1)\nException Investigation & Break Resolution\nFixed Income, Equities & FX\nSettlement Instructions (DTC, Fedwire, Euroclear)\nSWIFT MT Messaging\nPosition & Cash Reconciliation\nSSI Management\nSOP Creation & Process Documentation\nClient Relationship Management\nHedge Fund & Institutional Client Servicing\nTECHNICAL PROFICIENCIES\nPlatforms: CTM (DTCC), Traiana, MTM Trade Affirmation, NYFIX, Tradeweb TRAX, Deal Manager, AxEo, Markit\nMS Excel: VLOOKUP, INDEX-MATCH, Pivot Tables, Conditional Formatting, Data Validation",
    "certifications": "CERTIFICATIONS &\nCertification Program in Investment Banking Operations – Imarticus Learning (Aug 2023 – Dec 2023)",
    "awards": " ACHIEVEMENTS\nEmployee of the Quarter – Citco Group Services (India) LLP",
    "education": "EDUCATION\nMBA – MMS (Finance)\nMumbai University | 2022\nBachelor of Commerce – Accounting & Finance (B.Com-BAF)\nMumbai University | 2020",
    "languages": " & LANGUAGES\nLanguages: English, Hindi, Marathi"
  },
